WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:01.560
Xie Xuan

00:01.640 --> 00:02.720
You lead a unit

00:02.800 --> 00:03.680
Follow me down

00:03.760 --> 00:05.640
To welcome the volunteers into the city

00:05.720 --> 00:07.120
Your general receives orders

00:09.560 --> 00:10.360
Yuanzhi

00:10.440 --> 00:11.160
Here

00:11.240 --> 00:12.907
Send people to the north

00:13.000 --> 00:14.667
To watch for Wuzhao movements

00:15.080 --> 00:15.360
Your subject

00:15.520 --> 00:16.920
Receives orders

00:32.760 --> 00:34.520
Pay respects to you, sir

00:35.120 --> 00:36.280
Rise, rise

00:43.000 --> 01:02.000
Several internal factions, quarreling over safety and survival, escalated from bitter arguments into armed brawls, and thereafter attempted to abandon the city in anger.

